    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30109" root="عكم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَكَّمٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  A man <i>hard in the flesh, and</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَثِيرُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَفَاصِلِ</span> [app. a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَبِيرُ المَفَاصِلِ</span>
<i>large in the joints</i>]; likened to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِكْم</span>: and, accord. to IAar, a boy, or young man, <i>plump and
pampered.</i> (TA.)

